1. Home
Currency can be selected from create option and save in shared preference

Create transaction - Income and Expense
Income - id, category, title(optional), amount, date, type("income"), categoryIcon, year(int), month(int)
Expense - id, category, title(optional), amount, date, type("expense"), categoryIcon, year(int), month(int)
AllTransaction - id, category, title(optional), amount, date, type("expense"), categoryIcon, year(int), month(int)

Total Amount - sum up amount from AllTransaction

Total income - from income
Total expense - from expense

Recent transactions - show upto 10 transactions from all transaction table (Edit option)

See all - Show all transaction from all_transaction_table(Edit and Delete option)
Filter - By year, Month, Type(Income or expense)

2. History - Income And expense transaction tab - by month and year(header)

3. Wallet - Transactions by categories, Percentage graph of income and expense categories etc.

4. Settings - Notifications, Change Currency, Language, Privacy, About us, Logout

